ords of Guandong campaigned against Dong Zhuo, he and Governor of Danyang Zhou Xin jointly aided Cao Cao with 4,000 troops. Because of his close friendship with Cao Hong, he also gifted 2,000 elite armored soldiers of Lujiang, providing vital support for the expansion of Cao Cao's early faction. In the fourth year of Chuping, he was attacked and killed by Yuan Shu, who then assumed control over Yang Province.","jp":"後漢の官吏。揚州刺史を務め、豫州汝南郡の人。関東の諸侯が董卓を討伐した際、丹陽太守の周昕と共に曹操へ四千の兵力を援助し、また曹洪と親交があったことから廬江の上甲二千人を贈るなど、曹操初期の勢力拡大を支えた。初平四年、袁術に攻め殺され、袁術は自ら揚州の政務を掌握した。","kr":"동한의 관원으로 양주자사를 지냈으며 예주 여남군 출신이다. 관동 제후들이 동탁을 토벌할 때 단양태수 주흔과 함께 조조에게 병력 4천을 지원하였고, 조홍과의 두터운 친분으로 여강상갑 2천 명을 보내주어 조조의 초기 세력 확장을 뒷받침했다. 초평 4년 원술에게 공격받아 살해당했으며, 이후 원술이 스스로 양주의 정사를 도맡았다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1040315","remark":"","surname":"陈","surnameTc":"陳","surnameEn":"Chen","surnameJp":"陳","surnameKr":"진","surnameOther":"","name":"温","nameTc":"溫","nameEn":"Wen","nameJp":"温","nameKr":"온","nameOther":"","word":"元悌","wordTc":"元悌","wordEn":"Yuanti","wordJp":"元悌","wordKr":"원제","wordOther":"","icon":"陈温","power":"WJ10173","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1051","gender":"0","rule":"62","force":"49","wise":"61","politics":"72","charm":"68","will":"65","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"4","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"26/27/29/27/29/61/22/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1020705","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4000","battleSoulPoint":"4400","debateSoulPoint":"2100","strategy":"1003001","strategy2":"1010301","professions":"2/1/1/0/0/1/1/1/2/2/3/3/0/0/3/0/1/1/0/0/0/1/2/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compati